# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# Legacy trusted/ preserves automatic startup, not in-process loading.
# Both the clock and the menu-launched sketch have their own processes.
wait 25
note the folder window opened over it; the clock was there first
click-window trk_script
key w ctrl
wait 6
note the trusted application is already open, without being asked for
click-window Clock
wait 4
expect-title Clock
click 980 20
wait 4
note the example programs are under Demos, one row that expands
menu-pick Demos
wait 4
expect-menu Sketch
note choosing another app starts another runner process
menu-pick Sketch
wait 110
expect-title Sketch
key Escape
wait 20
expect-no-title Sketch
